// 专有名词前面可以有的大写词（不算「另一样东西」）
const CAP_OK = new Set(("I The A An In On At My Our Your Their His Her For Happy This That Last Next Every Since After Before During Until Over Merry Like Love Hate Celebrating Celebrate " +
  "Visiting Visited Went Going Just So And But Then Today Yesterday Tonight We You It Is Was Have Had Did Do Does Loving Missing Miss From To Near Around Back Home Real Proper Classic Typical Old New").split(" "));
// 常见的短词（中文两个字以内；英文一个词、全小写或很短）：单独一个对上容易链错，同一条动态里还要再对上这条的另一个词才画
